WEBVTT

01:34.920 --> 01:37.760
ADAPTED FROM DEMON KING
OF JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:37.840 --> 01:40.840
ORIGINAL WORK BY JIULU FEIXIANG

02:08.360 --> 02:10.919
This music is what I've been waiting for.

02:12.520 --> 02:14.160
What music?

02:14.240 --> 02:15.840
Why can't I hear it?

02:18.280 --> 02:19.360
This music…

02:21.600 --> 02:22.600
I've never heard

02:23.880 --> 02:25.640
this music before,

02:28.000 --> 02:30.000
but it seems that I've listened to it

02:32.560 --> 02:34.160
a million times.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.200
Well…

02:36.760 --> 02:39.400
Do you know the player?

02:40.560 --> 02:41.560
No.

02:43.320 --> 02:44.880
I don't know who the player is.

02:51.480 --> 02:52.920
It's bustling outside.

02:53.640 --> 02:55.280
Although I'm not going,

02:55.360 --> 02:56.840
you don't need to stay here.

02:57.880 --> 02:59.200
Go and have fun.

02:59.280 --> 03:00.440
Thank you, my lady.

03:00.520 --> 03:01.480
I'll be right back.

03:21.640 --> 03:22.520
Jieli.

03:24.520 --> 03:25.400
What's wrong?

03:26.600 --> 03:27.800
Where is Orchid?

03:27.880 --> 03:29.240
She's missing.

03:29.320 --> 03:30.280
Look for her.

03:31.080 --> 03:31.920
- Yes.
- Yes.

03:32.600 --> 03:33.600
Forget it.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.320
It's too troublesome.

03:36.400 --> 03:38.280
I'll move away all the people
on the street.

03:38.360 --> 03:39.560
- No.
- My lord.

03:42.840 --> 03:43.800
My lord.

03:43.880 --> 03:46.200
We've agreed that
we don't use magic powers in Lucheng.

03:48.000 --> 03:49.120
My lord, calm down.

03:49.200 --> 03:50.880
It may disturb the fate of Lady Chidi.

03:50.960 --> 03:51.840
You can't do that.

03:57.360 --> 03:58.280
My lord.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.880
Although Orchid's magical power is weak,

04:00.960 --> 04:03.720
it's more than enough for her
to deal with the mortals in Yunmeng Lake.

04:03.800 --> 04:05.400
I'll go and look for her now.

04:05.480 --> 04:07.720
If she is in any danger,

04:07.800 --> 04:09.920
I will throw you both
into the Oblivion River.

04:11.480 --> 04:12.320
Yes.

04:14.280 --> 04:15.160
Let's go.

04:17.839 --> 04:19.560
She is heartbroken
and wants to end her life.

04:19.640 --> 04:21.640
Then she meets her beloved
who understands her well.

04:21.720 --> 04:22.920
If my guess is right,

04:23.000 --> 04:25.640
the former God of War will be
at Flying Immortal Pavilion tonight.

04:25.720 --> 04:28.280
She will meet Lord Changheng
and fall in love at first sight.

04:28.360 --> 04:29.400
I have to keep watch.

04:29.480 --> 04:31.160
I can't let Big Blockhead disturb them.

04:42.840 --> 04:44.240
Xie Wanqing.

04:47.160 --> 04:48.600
That's the Flying Immortal Pavilion.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.040
It's time.

04:58.880 --> 04:59.760
My lord.

05:01.320 --> 05:03.080
Dongfang Qingcang appeared in Lucheng.

05:03.800 --> 05:04.880
I'm afraid

05:04.960 --> 05:07.200
he will disturb
the God of War's tribulation.

05:11.160 --> 05:12.640
What Dongfang Qingcang aims to do

05:13.600 --> 05:15.480
is to take my master's primordial spirit

05:16.160 --> 05:18.240
and unlock 100,000 soldiers
of the Moon Tribe.

05:18.880 --> 05:21.000
So before the hardship is completed,

05:21.080 --> 05:23.320
or before the wedding night
during the Flower Festival,

05:23.920 --> 05:25.480
he won't take any action.

05:27.720 --> 05:29.080
For over 30,000 years,

05:30.680 --> 05:32.040
I've been guarding her

05:33.400 --> 05:35.520
to avoid any problems
during her tribulations.

05:37.400 --> 05:39.800
I finally found the Goddess of Xishan.

05:40.320 --> 05:43.000
This is also the last tribulation
of my master.

05:45.880 --> 05:46.800
So,

05:47.480 --> 05:48.920
you must be careful

05:49.960 --> 05:51.320
and make sure everything goes well.

05:52.120 --> 05:53.720
After this life,

05:53.800 --> 05:55.960
my master can go back with me.

05:57.880 --> 05:58.960
Yes, my lord.

06:04.360 --> 06:05.600
I have no regrets.

06:17.800 --> 06:20.040
"The night of the Lantern Festival."

06:20.120 --> 06:21.920
"Meeting her beloved."

06:23.040 --> 06:24.680
She plans to end her life.

06:25.400 --> 06:27.240
Her beloved will stop her.

06:27.320 --> 06:29.000
But why hasn't her beloved

06:29.520 --> 06:31.000
shown up yet?

06:31.720 --> 06:32.720
Have a look.

06:32.800 --> 06:34.120
- Stop!
- Stop!

06:34.200 --> 06:35.520
- Stop!
- Stop!

06:35.600 --> 06:37.200
- Get out of the way!
- Over there!

06:37.280 --> 06:38.120
Stop!

06:38.840 --> 06:40.240
- Don't run!
- Stop!

06:40.320 --> 06:41.840
- Don't run.
- Here.

06:41.920 --> 06:42.800
Move!

06:44.800 --> 06:46.600
- Don't run!
- Stop!

06:47.560 --> 06:49.640
FLYING IMMORTAL PAVILION

07:14.360 --> 07:15.880
Where are you going?

07:16.840 --> 07:17.680
Wait.

07:18.320 --> 07:20.400
We are on familiar terms with each other.

07:20.480 --> 07:21.560
Why do you have to do this?

07:21.640 --> 07:23.480
- Give me the jade.
- Hand it over!

07:23.560 --> 07:24.680
No.

07:25.440 --> 07:27.120
I was born with this jade.

07:27.200 --> 07:28.280
I can't give it to you.

07:29.000 --> 07:29.880
How about this?

07:30.760 --> 07:31.920
When my father calms down,

07:32.000 --> 07:34.080
I'll pay you double.

07:34.160 --> 07:35.040
All right?

07:35.120 --> 07:36.800
- I don't care who you are.
- Take it!

07:36.880 --> 07:38.680
- You dare to play tricks in our casino?
- No!

07:38.760 --> 07:41.120
- No!
- You have to suffer a lot.

07:41.680 --> 07:43.520
- I can't give it to you.
- Mr. Xiao.

07:43.600 --> 07:46.600
- I have to give it to my destined lover!
- You don't have to suffer this for a jade.

07:46.680 --> 07:47.680
Give it to me.

07:49.800 --> 07:50.840
How dare you bite me?

07:50.920 --> 07:52.160
- Beat him!
- Beat him!

07:52.720 --> 07:53.800
Stop!

07:59.280 --> 08:01.160
It's perfectly justified to pay the debt.

08:01.240 --> 08:02.600
Where did this wild girl come from?

08:02.680 --> 08:04.280
You'd better mind your own business.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.280
Leave!

08:05.360 --> 08:06.480
Let him go!

08:06.560 --> 08:08.400
Otherwise, don't blame me
for being rude to you.

08:09.960 --> 08:10.880
She's a heroine.

08:10.960 --> 08:13.200
What? Want to show off your bravery?

08:14.200 --> 08:15.160
Attack!

08:15.240 --> 08:16.360
Go!

08:37.640 --> 08:38.559
Stop!

08:47.400 --> 08:48.720
Within the three realms,

08:48.800 --> 08:50.280
you, as a woman,

08:50.360 --> 08:52.320
cannot kill me.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.600
Is it you?

09:08.120 --> 09:09.000
We…

09:11.160 --> 09:12.880
Have we met before?

09:12.960 --> 09:14.080
Never.

09:15.320 --> 09:16.280
The music…

09:18.800 --> 09:20.080
Was the music just now

09:21.400 --> 09:22.720
from you?

09:22.800 --> 09:24.000
What music?

09:38.360 --> 09:39.400
It's you.

09:41.240 --> 09:42.600
It must be you.

09:44.240 --> 09:45.680
Why did I feel hate,

09:47.280 --> 09:48.800
respect,

09:50.280 --> 09:51.600
and concern

09:53.880 --> 09:55.080
at the same time

09:57.760 --> 09:59.640
when I saw you?

10:03.560 --> 10:06.160
It's like I've been entangled with you
for ages.

10:12.480 --> 10:14.160
I think I was waiting for you.

10:16.400 --> 10:17.240
You're drunk.

10:18.400 --> 10:19.400
I'm drunk?

10:25.360 --> 10:26.720
Look at this muddy world.

10:28.240 --> 10:29.560
Everyone is drunk.

10:30.400 --> 10:32.360
I'm just dreaming.

10:33.720 --> 10:35.040
At this moment,

10:35.120 --> 10:36.600
I should wake up from my dream.

10:46.080 --> 10:47.480
You can't die.

11:12.320 --> 11:14.160
We met in our previous life.

11:18.240 --> 11:19.080
Who are you?

11:32.240 --> 11:34.200
How could this happen?

11:34.280 --> 11:35.840
Where is her beloved?

11:35.920 --> 11:36.960
He should have appeared.

12:04.000 --> 12:05.160
Are you all right?

12:09.520 --> 12:10.640
Have we

12:10.720 --> 12:12.400
met before?

12:18.600 --> 12:20.520
No.

12:20.600 --> 12:22.760
You must have mistaken me
for someone else.

12:22.840 --> 12:25.360
Since you are fine, I shall take my leave.

12:26.080 --> 12:27.960
No, I can't be wrong.

12:28.040 --> 12:28.880
- I…
- No.

12:30.920 --> 12:31.840
Last month,

12:31.920 --> 12:33.440
we met at the mansion of Duke Zhongyi.

12:33.520 --> 12:34.800
At that time,

12:34.880 --> 12:36.600
his wife was training
with female generals.

12:37.320 --> 12:38.840
You knocked off my hair bun.

12:38.920 --> 12:40.800
What? What female generals?

12:40.880 --> 12:41.920
I've never heard of it.

12:42.560 --> 12:43.520
How forgetful I am!

12:44.400 --> 12:46.960
It's rare to see
such a beautiful technique.

12:47.040 --> 12:49.640
You must be the legitimate heir
of the magician of Liuyun Theatre.

12:49.720 --> 12:51.760
Half a month ago,
I watched your performance.

12:51.840 --> 12:53.840
Sir, you must be mistaken.

12:53.920 --> 12:55.840
We've never seen each other in this life.

12:56.760 --> 12:57.920
I remember now.

12:58.000 --> 13:00.160
There is a beautiful fairy in my dream.

13:00.240 --> 13:01.960
She looks very similar to you.

13:02.760 --> 13:03.800
You and I

13:03.880 --> 13:05.320
must have a relationship in heaven.

13:07.440 --> 13:08.960
Heroine, wait.

13:09.040 --> 13:10.280
I haven't asked your name yet.

13:10.360 --> 13:12.320
Where do you live? What's your name?

13:26.920 --> 13:28.160
Heroine.

13:33.480 --> 13:35.160
- Heroine.
- It's almost midnight.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.800
Why is the lord still wandering here?

13:36.880 --> 13:38.680
Why isn't he going to meet Xie Wanqing?

13:39.560 --> 13:42.160
After the night of the Lantern Festival,
the fate will be changed.

13:53.360 --> 13:55.520
I was worried about you
and looked for you everywhere.

13:55.600 --> 13:58.200
But you're here
to meet Changheng secretly.

13:59.080 --> 14:00.480
Changheng?

14:00.560 --> 14:03.080
Isn't Lord Changheng at Shuiyuntian?

14:03.160 --> 14:04.240
You got the wrong person.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.280
You are still lying.

14:05.880 --> 14:07.680
Do you really think I am a child

14:07.760 --> 14:09.520
who will be fooled by your tricks?

14:10.080 --> 14:11.400
At the Flying Immortal Pavilion,

14:11.480 --> 14:13.760
I found that Changheng is also
experiencing tribulations.

14:14.760 --> 14:16.920
Everything you said and did

14:17.000 --> 14:18.520
was just covering up for Changheng.

14:19.520 --> 14:20.600
Even so,

14:21.800 --> 14:24.960
I would rather believe it when you said

14:25.040 --> 14:27.080
the Bone Orchid I gave you is priceless.

14:27.160 --> 14:28.120
But you…

14:28.200 --> 14:29.320
Yes.

14:29.400 --> 14:30.480
I lied to you.

14:30.560 --> 14:31.520
What about you?

14:32.480 --> 14:34.360
Why did you come to Lucheng?

14:34.440 --> 14:36.040
You said you came to hang around with me.

14:36.120 --> 14:38.320
But you came for the primordial spirit
of the God of War, right?

14:40.360 --> 14:41.560
How did you know?

14:43.040 --> 14:44.280
Jieli told you?

14:44.360 --> 14:45.640
She didn't say anything.

14:45.720 --> 14:47.520
I guessed it according to the fate poem.

14:49.240 --> 14:51.720
How smart you are,
the head disciple of the Arbiter!

14:51.800 --> 14:53.320
Since you are so good at guessing,

14:53.400 --> 14:56.080
did you know
about Changheng's hardship long ago?

14:58.280 --> 14:59.240
I…

15:00.240 --> 15:02.320
Good. Very good.

15:02.880 --> 15:04.760
No wonder you came to Lucheng
without permission

15:04.840 --> 15:06.880
and claimed that
you wanted to hang with me.

15:06.960 --> 15:08.080
So you had a plan.

15:08.160 --> 15:09.120
I didn't.

15:09.200 --> 15:10.400
I knew it not long ago.

15:11.440 --> 15:13.280
This is a rare opportunity.

15:13.360 --> 15:15.920
I'm going to kill Changheng now

15:16.000 --> 15:17.880
and get rid of a big trouble
for Cangyan Sea.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.640
No. You can't kill him.

15:19.720 --> 15:21.200
Lord Changheng is the beloved!

15:22.760 --> 15:23.800
What did you say?

15:23.880 --> 15:27.160
Xiao Run was betrothed
to Xie Wanqing before birth

15:27.240 --> 15:28.720
and offered a lot of money to propose.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.840
They will show up
at Flying Immortal Pavilion tonight.

15:30.920 --> 15:32.080
There must be no mistake.

15:32.640 --> 15:34.080
If you kill him on impulse,

15:34.160 --> 15:36.480
Xie Wanqing's fate will change too.

15:40.800 --> 15:42.720
It's because of you.

15:43.800 --> 15:45.440
What do you mean?

15:46.000 --> 15:47.320
If Changheng

15:47.400 --> 15:49.520
is the beloved in the poem as you said,

15:49.600 --> 15:51.840
then he didn't show up on time

15:51.920 --> 15:53.200
because he wasted time

15:53.280 --> 15:55.160
pushing and pulling with you

15:55.240 --> 15:56.360
and thus changed his fate.

15:56.440 --> 15:58.480
If I hadn't stopped Xie Wanqing,

15:58.560 --> 16:00.680
she would have already died.

16:01.440 --> 16:02.440
What?

16:02.520 --> 16:04.640
You stopped Xie Wanqing?

16:04.720 --> 16:06.040
Why are you so nosy?

16:06.120 --> 16:07.640
It's not her fate.

16:07.720 --> 16:09.680
If I didn't stop her and let her die,

16:09.760 --> 16:11.400
there would be no turning back.

16:12.880 --> 16:13.880
This is bad.

16:14.440 --> 16:16.520
They've missed the destined time.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.160
They should have fallen in love tonight,

16:18.240 --> 16:19.960
but they didn't meet each other.

16:20.040 --> 16:22.560
If things don't happen
according to the fate poem,

16:22.640 --> 16:25.080
the two of them will fail
in the tribulation…

16:26.480 --> 16:29.560
- and their primordial spirits will perish.
- Their primordial spirits will perish.

16:37.880 --> 16:40.200
EVERLASTING ORCHID

16:54.440 --> 16:55.320
Xiao Run.

16:55.880 --> 16:57.560
After coming home today,

16:57.640 --> 16:59.600
you look as if you've lost your soul.

17:00.480 --> 17:02.040
You've been staring at the blank paper

17:03.000 --> 17:04.280
for the whole night.

17:05.920 --> 17:06.920
You don't understand.

17:07.000 --> 17:09.079
If I don't draw when I am fully prepared,

17:09.160 --> 17:11.040
I will offend that heroine.

17:14.440 --> 17:15.440
Xiao Run.

17:17.280 --> 17:18.880
It's 1:30 a.m.

17:19.400 --> 17:21.000
After school tomorrow,

17:21.079 --> 17:23.960
you need to visit Lady Wanqing
at the Flying Immortal Pavilion.

17:24.599 --> 17:25.680
Rest early.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.600
I won't go there tomorrow.

17:32.920 --> 17:34.840
It's not Lady Wanqing.

17:34.920 --> 17:36.360
I was wrong.

17:38.680 --> 17:40.160
That heroine

17:40.240 --> 17:42.440
is the actual fairy in my dream.

17:44.240 --> 17:45.240
Another girl?

17:47.480 --> 17:49.080
What do you mean?

17:50.560 --> 17:51.800
It's different this time.

17:51.880 --> 17:52.800
I can feel

17:52.880 --> 17:55.000
that the heroine is the fairy in my dream.

17:56.640 --> 17:58.320
I was born with this jade.

17:58.400 --> 17:59.400
I was born for her.

18:13.560 --> 18:14.480
Then…

18:16.800 --> 18:18.240
Xiao Run, take your time.

18:57.320 --> 18:58.360
Who are you?

19:03.840 --> 19:05.760
You are Fairy Danyin.

19:08.120 --> 19:09.320
Are you a thief?

19:09.400 --> 19:10.880
Guards!

19:10.960 --> 19:12.280
Help!

19:12.360 --> 19:13.680
- Help!
- Qu Shui!

19:13.760 --> 19:15.800
Thief!

19:20.640 --> 19:21.920
Qu Shui!

19:25.120 --> 19:26.760
Who dares to break into Xiao's Mansion?

19:29.560 --> 19:30.720
I came to Lucheng.

19:30.800 --> 19:32.400
You also came to Lucheng.

19:32.480 --> 19:34.080
You and I are destined to meet.

19:36.880 --> 19:37.720
How…

19:40.240 --> 19:41.400
You bandit, I'll beat you!

20:10.400 --> 20:11.280
Stop!

20:12.160 --> 20:13.080
Let him go!

20:14.520 --> 20:16.520
Sir, you must be mistaken.

20:16.600 --> 20:18.640
There is a beautiful fairy in my dream.

20:18.720 --> 20:20.000
She looks very similar to you.

20:21.200 --> 20:22.240
You and I

20:22.320 --> 20:23.800
must have a relationship in heaven.

20:34.360 --> 20:36.800
Why isn't he back yet?

20:46.480 --> 20:48.160
So? Did it go well?

20:48.720 --> 20:50.680
It's easy to erase

20:50.760 --> 20:51.600
a mortal's memory.

20:54.920 --> 20:55.800
No.

20:55.880 --> 20:57.680
The problem is not fully solved yet.

20:57.760 --> 21:00.080
Even if Xiao Run's memory
of meeting me was erased,

21:00.160 --> 21:02.360
he still hasn't met Xie Wanqing.

21:24.160 --> 21:25.560
You…

21:25.640 --> 21:27.000
Why are you looking at me?

21:28.600 --> 21:30.160
Orchid, you fix Destiny Books.

21:30.240 --> 21:32.600
No one knows about tribulations
better than you.

21:32.680 --> 21:33.760
Hurry up and find a way!

21:35.920 --> 21:37.120
Let me get it straight.

21:37.200 --> 21:39.280
On the night of the Lantern Festival,

21:39.360 --> 21:41.400
the God of War Changheng or Xiao Run,

21:41.480 --> 21:44.920
was destined to meet Lady Chidi,
Xie Wanqing,

21:45.000 --> 21:46.320
at the Flying Immortal Pavilion

21:46.400 --> 21:49.040
and save Xie Wanqing
who would fall off the building.

21:49.120 --> 21:50.560
They'd fall in love with each other.

21:52.160 --> 21:54.640
But because Big Blockhead and I
were careless,

21:54.720 --> 21:56.320
they missed each other.

21:59.280 --> 22:00.920
Because of you two,

22:01.000 --> 22:02.720
their fates

22:02.800 --> 22:04.200
deviated from the…

22:05.000 --> 22:05.840
Fate poem.

22:05.920 --> 22:07.520
Yes. Fate poem.

22:08.080 --> 22:09.960
If they didn't meet,
they wouldn't be in love.

22:10.520 --> 22:12.760
If they aren't in love,
they won't get married.

22:12.840 --> 22:13.960
If so,

22:14.040 --> 22:16.440
Xie Wanqing won't be able
to be killed by Xiao Run

22:16.520 --> 22:18.080
on the wedding night.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.200
I have a question.

22:20.280 --> 22:22.760
Since Changheng wanted to marry her,
why would he kill her?

22:22.840 --> 22:24.440
I'm also curious about this.

22:24.520 --> 22:27.080
Lord Changheng is a person
who values love and loyalty.

22:27.160 --> 22:28.960
Why would he kill Xie Wanqing?

22:29.040 --> 22:30.000
Yes.

22:32.080 --> 22:34.520
Is there someone who values
love and loyalty in the Fairy Realm?

22:34.600 --> 22:36.400
This is the first time I've ever known it.

22:36.480 --> 22:38.440
My lord, Changheng is a mortal now.

22:38.520 --> 22:40.440
A mortal is able to value love

22:41.520 --> 22:42.520
and loyalty.

22:43.920 --> 22:46.000
Don't stray from the point.
This is not important.

22:46.080 --> 22:49.160
Anyway, if nothing in the fate poem
happens now,

22:49.240 --> 22:51.600
then the hardship experience
of Changheng and Lady Chidi

22:51.680 --> 22:52.600
will be a failure.

22:52.680 --> 22:55.320
Their primordial spirits

22:55.400 --> 22:56.520
will vanish.

22:57.160 --> 22:58.040
Am I right?

22:59.400 --> 23:01.440
Accidents before the tribulation
are not terrible.

23:01.520 --> 23:04.000
What's important
is the tribulation experience.

23:04.080 --> 23:06.480
If they are destined to love each other,

23:06.560 --> 23:08.080
how they meet doesn't matter.

23:09.640 --> 23:11.000
I know!

23:11.080 --> 23:11.920
I see!

23:12.400 --> 23:13.680
You understand too?

23:13.760 --> 23:15.360
- No.
- Then why did you say that?

23:15.440 --> 23:17.120
I was trying to lighten the atmosphere.

23:20.520 --> 23:21.640
So what do you know now?

23:23.360 --> 23:24.360
Think about it.

23:24.440 --> 23:26.920
As long as they get married
during the Flower Festival,

23:27.000 --> 23:30.800
the fate poem will still come true
and the tribulation will succeed.

23:30.880 --> 23:33.240
So our main task now

23:33.320 --> 23:35.640
is to make them fall in love before that.

23:36.800 --> 23:38.840
But they already missed
the best opportunity.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.480
How can we make them fall in love?

23:40.560 --> 23:41.640
You don't understand.

23:41.720 --> 23:42.880
Xiao Run and Xie Wanqing

23:42.960 --> 23:44.800
are a match made in heaven.

23:44.880 --> 23:47.680
This little setback can't tear them apart.

23:47.760 --> 23:49.000
Look.

23:49.080 --> 23:51.840
Xiao Run doesn't value
fame and fortune at all.

23:51.920 --> 23:54.240
He refuses to follow
his family's arrangement.

23:54.320 --> 23:57.400
Xie Wanqing doesn't value
wealth and splendor.

23:57.480 --> 23:59.240
She refuses to care about worldly taste.

23:59.320 --> 24:00.960
They don't do anything against their will.

24:01.040 --> 24:02.840
Aren't they a perfect match?

24:02.920 --> 24:05.640
So now, as long as they meet,

24:05.720 --> 24:08.440
fate will naturally lead them
to fall in love at first sight.

24:09.560 --> 24:10.600
There's no time to lose.

24:10.680 --> 24:13.000
I'll go find Xiao Run
and ask him to meet Xie Wanqing.

24:13.080 --> 24:14.080
Don't go.

24:17.680 --> 24:19.880
I went to erase Xiao Run's memory

24:19.960 --> 24:22.120
to avoid more trouble.

24:22.800 --> 24:24.680
If you go there rashly,

24:24.760 --> 24:26.000
it would be in vain.

24:28.040 --> 24:28.880
Exactly.

24:28.960 --> 24:31.280
The relations between men and women
should develop naturally.

24:31.360 --> 24:33.920
Orchid, it's not appropriate for you
to go find Xiao Run.

24:34.000 --> 24:34.840
Exactly.

24:36.080 --> 24:37.240
Since you want to be a mortal,

24:37.320 --> 24:39.320
you must follow the rules of mortals.

24:40.720 --> 24:43.720
How about letting Moon Supreme
and Shangque get close to Xiao Run?

24:44.480 --> 24:47.360
As for Xie Wanqing,
Orchid and I will take charge of her.

24:47.440 --> 24:49.640
After getting along with them,

24:49.720 --> 24:51.360
we'll find a way to let them meet.

24:52.080 --> 24:53.320
What do you think? Any problem?

24:53.400 --> 24:54.800
- No.
- We can't do this.

24:54.880 --> 24:55.800
Why?

24:58.800 --> 25:00.920
You're afraid I'll take Changheng's life,
aren't you?

25:01.560 --> 25:03.600
You underestimate me.

25:03.680 --> 25:05.040
He's a mortal now.

25:05.120 --> 25:06.040
He has no power.

25:06.120 --> 25:07.440
If I kill him,

25:07.520 --> 25:09.800
I'm not different from those hypocrites

25:09.880 --> 25:10.920
in the Fairy Realm.

25:11.000 --> 25:12.960
Are you sure you won't hurt him?

25:13.040 --> 25:14.600
The tribulation is more important now.

25:14.680 --> 25:17.040
I don't have time to waste energy
in the Mortal World.

25:18.160 --> 25:20.240
Let's do it then.

25:20.320 --> 25:22.280
Wait. I still don't understand.

25:22.360 --> 25:24.120
- I still have questions.
- Good. Dismissed.

25:24.200 --> 25:25.520
Wait, listen to me.

25:25.600 --> 25:26.680
Let's go.

25:26.760 --> 25:28.120
- Wait.
- Come on.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.360
I haven't finished yet.

25:32.920 --> 25:34.240
Wait.

25:34.320 --> 25:36.400
I have something to tell you. Sit down.

25:45.080 --> 25:46.160
What do you want to say?

26:01.760 --> 26:02.800
You are awake, my lady?

26:05.000 --> 26:06.120
Are you feeling unwell?

26:07.560 --> 26:09.720
You were drunk on the rooftop last night.

26:10.280 --> 26:11.520
If you caught a cold,

26:11.600 --> 26:13.400
it would be my fault.

26:14.880 --> 26:16.560
Last night, I saw someone

26:16.640 --> 26:17.760
on the rooftop.

26:19.080 --> 26:20.640
He was very mysterious.

26:20.720 --> 26:22.000
He came in the moonlight.

26:23.480 --> 26:25.080
Except for me,

26:25.160 --> 26:26.880
no one went to the rooftop last night.

26:27.680 --> 26:29.480
You must've been drunk.

26:29.560 --> 26:30.480
You had a dream.

26:31.800 --> 26:32.680
Impossible.

26:33.640 --> 26:34.920
I remember it clearly.

26:43.440 --> 26:44.360
That person…

26:53.200 --> 26:54.400
Could it be

26:54.480 --> 26:55.960
really a dream?

26:56.040 --> 26:59.320
My lady, you must have been wanting
to find a perfect husband.

26:59.400 --> 27:01.400
That's why you had that dream.

27:02.560 --> 27:03.960
INVITATION

27:04.040 --> 27:04.920
What is this?

27:05.480 --> 27:06.800
SPRING BANQUET

27:06.880 --> 27:08.840
Gosh, I forgot to tell you.

27:08.920 --> 27:12.560
This is the invitation sent by Lady Cui
from Shiyu Pavilion

27:12.640 --> 27:15.320
to invite you to the Spring Banquet
ten days from today.

27:18.040 --> 27:19.160
Those royal descendants

27:19.240 --> 27:21.640
and noble ladies of noble families

27:21.720 --> 27:24.520
always recite poems
and play grass games during the banquet.

27:24.600 --> 27:26.160
It happens every year.

27:26.240 --> 27:27.400
I'm tired of it.

27:29.360 --> 27:30.360
Decline it for me.

27:31.360 --> 27:32.560
Yes.

27:32.640 --> 27:33.480
Wait.

27:48.600 --> 27:50.640
Get the best gardener in Lucheng for me.

27:50.720 --> 27:51.600
Yes.

28:12.880 --> 28:14.320
Xiao Run!

28:16.040 --> 28:16.880
Xiao Run!

28:22.400 --> 28:25.400
Why are we sleeping in the yard?

28:27.920 --> 28:29.000
Right.

28:29.680 --> 28:30.640
Last night,

28:31.960 --> 28:33.040
there was a thief.

28:34.120 --> 28:35.120
I was so scared that I…

28:36.240 --> 28:37.080
And then?

28:38.120 --> 28:39.000
I passed out.

28:42.720 --> 28:44.480
Xiao Run, are you all right?

28:45.440 --> 28:46.520
I'm fine.

28:46.600 --> 28:49.200
But I feel as if

28:49.280 --> 28:51.640
I forgot something important.

28:54.360 --> 28:55.800
Xiao Run.

28:55.880 --> 28:56.840
Don't scare me.

28:56.920 --> 28:58.560
Did you hurt your brain

28:58.640 --> 29:00.640
when you fought against the thief?

29:03.080 --> 29:03.920
Or

29:04.760 --> 29:06.840
did you come across ghosts?

29:07.680 --> 29:10.400
In broad daylight,
it's impossible to see ghosts.

29:12.800 --> 29:13.760
What time is it now?

29:20.240 --> 29:21.720
It should be

29:21.800 --> 29:23.120
around 7:00 a.m. now.

29:26.960 --> 29:28.600
Hurry! Pack up!

29:28.680 --> 29:30.960
If my old man knows I missed school,
I will be skinned!

29:31.040 --> 29:32.120
Move!

29:42.080 --> 29:42.920
Xiao Run.

29:43.000 --> 29:45.240
Xiao Run, hurry up! It's late.

29:48.640 --> 29:49.600
What are you doing?

29:52.280 --> 29:53.400
Where is this painting from?

29:54.400 --> 29:57.080
You painted it yourself yesterday.
Did you forget?

29:57.160 --> 29:58.920
We are really late!

29:59.480 --> 30:01.080
This must be drawn in my dream.

30:02.360 --> 30:04.800
The woman in the painting
must be the fairy in my dream.

30:04.880 --> 30:05.840
Qu Shui!

30:07.120 --> 30:08.000
I know everything.

30:08.800 --> 30:09.720
Know what?

30:10.800 --> 30:12.600
I know what she looks like.

30:12.680 --> 30:14.360
I finally know.

30:14.440 --> 30:17.000
Qu Shui, I finally know!

30:19.120 --> 30:21.920
Dark Golden Glory is the best
among peonies.

30:22.000 --> 30:23.560
It's the most delicate.

30:23.640 --> 30:24.880
Since the day I planted it,

30:24.960 --> 30:26.440
I've been taking care of it every day.

30:27.000 --> 30:28.480
I've invited countless gardeners,

30:28.560 --> 30:30.400
but no one can make it bloom.

30:31.320 --> 30:32.960
Lady Orchid,
you are an excellent gardener.

30:33.040 --> 30:34.560
Now it has buds.

30:35.360 --> 30:36.640
Don't worry.

30:36.720 --> 30:39.160
I'll make sure it blooms
before the Spring Banquet.

30:40.600 --> 30:42.400
I heard that Lady Orchid is renowned

30:42.480 --> 30:44.440
as Jinling's head of flower fairies.

30:45.280 --> 30:46.640
It shows that the rumor is true.

30:48.720 --> 30:50.960
I'm flattered.

30:53.320 --> 30:56.720
I've heard that Jinling
is full of talented people.

30:56.800 --> 30:58.560
Lady Orchid, don't be modest.

30:59.760 --> 31:02.560
I'm just an ordinary person.

31:03.520 --> 31:05.320
I accepted your invitation

31:05.400 --> 31:06.800
for a personal reason.

31:07.440 --> 31:09.720
If I can accompany you
to the Spring Banquet,

31:09.800 --> 31:12.360
maybe I can meet a fated person.

31:14.040 --> 31:16.880
A young gentleman will be attracted
to beautiful ladies.

31:16.960 --> 31:18.680
If you can meet someone you like,

31:18.760 --> 31:20.320
it will be good.

31:20.400 --> 31:22.200
Do you have someone

31:22.280 --> 31:23.600
in your heart?

31:28.200 --> 31:30.240
Maybe my destined one

31:30.320 --> 31:32.080
is the moon in the sky.

31:34.560 --> 31:37.080
The moon in the sky is bright and clear,

31:37.640 --> 31:39.600
and it always hangs in the sky.

31:39.680 --> 31:40.800
It's untouchable.

31:42.040 --> 31:43.640
Xie Wanqing's dream lover

31:43.720 --> 31:45.200
really is Lord Changheng.

31:57.200 --> 31:58.480
"It is the year of Guichou.

31:58.560 --> 32:01.160
On one of those late spring days,
we gather at the Orchid Pavilion

32:01.240 --> 32:03.160
to dispel bad luck
and pray for good fortune.

32:03.240 --> 32:05.000
The attendees of the gathering…"

32:16.440 --> 32:17.880
Xiao Run, the teacher is coming.

32:28.680 --> 32:29.800
This is…

32:29.880 --> 32:30.720
It's you.

32:40.040 --> 32:41.080
You are

32:41.160 --> 32:43.400
the rich merchant
who bought the Night Stream Building!

32:43.960 --> 32:45.040
It's him.

32:45.120 --> 32:46.680
- It's him?
- So this is him.

32:47.360 --> 32:49.560
He bought the Night Stream Building?

32:49.640 --> 32:50.760
Silence!

32:54.400 --> 32:55.680
This is Mr. Dongfang.

32:55.760 --> 32:57.520
He will be your classmate from now on.

32:58.520 --> 32:59.800
I haven't finished yet.

32:59.880 --> 33:00.800
What else can you say?

33:00.880 --> 33:02.040
Let the class begin.

33:02.560 --> 33:04.040
Look at his vibe.

33:05.680 --> 33:07.000
So impressive.

33:07.080 --> 33:08.080
Yes.

33:18.560 --> 33:19.400
All right.

33:20.120 --> 33:21.560
Let's continue to review.

33:24.000 --> 33:25.280
Mr. Dongfang.

33:25.360 --> 33:28.040
You really have an impressive presence.

33:28.120 --> 33:29.000
Nice to meet you.

33:30.720 --> 33:33.560
My name is widely known
because of my money.

33:33.640 --> 33:34.880
These mortals

33:34.960 --> 33:36.080
are so dull.

33:38.760 --> 33:40.200
Mr. Dongfang,

33:40.280 --> 33:41.840
you're really extraordinary.

33:46.720 --> 33:47.800
Stop whispering!

33:48.360 --> 33:49.960
You two, get out!

33:53.000 --> 33:55.600
Mr. Dongfang, I'm talking to you.

34:00.120 --> 34:02.280
- How dare you talk to me like that?
- Calm down, sir.

34:15.440 --> 34:18.719
RECTIFICATION, CULTIVATION,
CONTEMPLATION, DILIGENCE

34:18.800 --> 34:19.639
Mr. Dongfang.

34:19.719 --> 34:22.280
There is a Cuju match
in the west of the city.

34:22.360 --> 34:24.080
Why don't we go and have a look?

34:24.639 --> 34:25.920
School is not over yet.

34:26.000 --> 34:27.639
Someone must be guarding the front gate.

34:28.199 --> 34:29.719
I have a good plan.

34:31.920 --> 34:33.320
You two stay here.

34:33.960 --> 34:35.600
Let's go!

34:35.679 --> 34:36.560
Go!

34:51.520 --> 34:53.639
Mr. Dongfang, hurry up! No one is here.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.400
Mr. Dongfang!

35:02.600 --> 35:03.840
Mr. Dongfang, hurry up!

35:04.960 --> 35:06.120
- Mr. Dongfang!
- I'm coming.

35:12.480 --> 35:13.320
Hurry up.

35:17.480 --> 35:18.320
Come on.

35:18.400 --> 35:19.320
Be careful.

35:19.960 --> 35:21.320
Be careful.

35:29.360 --> 35:31.320
I can't believe
I just crawled through a dog hole

35:31.400 --> 35:32.760
with Changheng hand in hand.

35:32.840 --> 35:33.880
What did you say?

35:34.760 --> 35:36.640
- Nothing.
- Who is sneaking around?

35:37.440 --> 35:38.280
Let's go.

35:41.920 --> 35:42.920
Mr. Xiao.

35:43.000 --> 35:44.280
It's you again.

35:47.160 --> 35:48.200
Master.

35:48.280 --> 35:50.720
It's almost lunchtime.

35:50.800 --> 35:52.520
Have you eaten?

35:53.000 --> 35:54.400
Mr. Xiao.

35:54.480 --> 35:56.640
You've been idling about

35:56.720 --> 35:58.680
and fooling around all day long.

35:59.640 --> 36:01.160
You're stubborn.

36:01.240 --> 36:03.320
You don't focus on your studies at all.

36:04.080 --> 36:05.720
Today, you even crawled through
the dog hole.

36:05.800 --> 36:07.280
You've humiliated yourself.

36:07.840 --> 36:10.000
If it weren't for your father's sake,

36:10.080 --> 36:11.800
- I would have told the secretary.
- Forget it.

36:11.880 --> 36:13.000
I should just do as she says.

36:13.080 --> 36:15.040
- And you.
- Master.

36:15.120 --> 36:17.440
Mr. Dongfang just tried to persuade me
not to do this.

36:17.520 --> 36:19.400
He wanted to drag me back, so he…

36:20.240 --> 36:21.400
It has nothing to do with him.

36:21.480 --> 36:22.680
I forced him out.

36:23.760 --> 36:24.720
Let's run!

36:26.320 --> 36:27.560
You are…

36:27.640 --> 36:29.160
not worth being taught!

36:35.800 --> 36:36.760
WENJUN PAVILION

36:36.840 --> 36:38.600
RECTIFICATION, CULTIVATION,
CONTEMPLATION, DILIGENCE

36:38.680 --> 36:40.040
Shangque, where are they?

36:41.640 --> 36:43.440
They were punished to stand,

36:43.520 --> 36:44.520
but disappeared together.

36:45.200 --> 36:47.080
What? Disappeared together?

37:00.600 --> 37:05.560
RECTIFICATION, CULTIVATION,
CONTEMPLATION, DILIGENCE

37:09.400 --> 37:10.680
HONESTY

37:25.000 --> 37:26.280
THREE POINTS

37:26.360 --> 37:29.840
TEAM BLUE, TEAM RED

37:29.920 --> 37:31.960
It's luck that made you win today.

37:33.840 --> 37:35.480
You still won't admit defeat?

37:35.560 --> 37:37.000
- Let's compete another day.
- Let's go.

37:38.880 --> 37:40.120
- Let's go back.
- Let's go.

37:40.200 --> 37:41.240
Mr. Dongfang.

37:41.320 --> 37:43.320
That kick just now was amazing.

37:43.400 --> 37:44.920
They were all out of their wits.

37:49.360 --> 37:50.360
Mr. Dongfang!

37:59.000 --> 38:00.200
I didn't expect that

38:00.280 --> 38:01.760
you would be so good at Cuju.

38:01.840 --> 38:03.040
Teach me if you have time.

38:04.280 --> 38:05.840
When I was young, Father and I…

38:08.480 --> 38:10.840
My father and I
often played Cuju together.

38:10.920 --> 38:12.520
He taught me

38:12.600 --> 38:14.080
a lot of techniques.

38:15.440 --> 38:17.280
Your father even taught you to play Cuju?

38:20.600 --> 38:23.240
My old man always tells me
not to be a boy without ambitions.

38:23.320 --> 38:25.320
I should focus on studying
and earning fame.

38:27.640 --> 38:29.040
In my opinion,

38:29.120 --> 38:31.640
I don't care about fame and fortune.

38:31.720 --> 38:34.760
This wooden ball
is the best thing in the world.

38:35.800 --> 38:36.760
That's right!

38:38.200 --> 38:40.600
It's said that it's hard

38:40.680 --> 38:42.400
to find a bosom friend.

38:42.480 --> 38:44.000
I didn't expect that

38:44.080 --> 38:45.640
I could find a confidant today.

38:52.920 --> 38:54.360
Wait.

38:54.440 --> 38:56.520
I have something to tell you. Sit down.

38:58.560 --> 39:00.080
Next time when you meet your friends,

39:00.160 --> 39:02.080
don't always pull a long face.

39:02.160 --> 39:04.720
If you don't know how to answer him,

39:04.800 --> 39:06.240
just smile at him.

39:06.320 --> 39:07.680
Smile again?

39:07.760 --> 39:10.920
Didn't I teach you that
when you made peace with Xunfeng?

39:14.720 --> 39:15.720
Like this.

39:18.800 --> 39:19.760
Do you remember?

40:02.160 --> 40:03.240
Mr. Dongfang.

40:03.320 --> 40:04.720
How did you hurt your hand?

40:05.920 --> 40:07.160
I'm fine.

40:15.920 --> 40:16.960
What are you doing?

40:17.040 --> 40:18.680
It's the medicine I made for knife wounds.

40:18.760 --> 40:21.200
When my father flogged me,
I relied on this to survive.

40:22.960 --> 40:23.920
Don't move.
